      "finding_id": "plain:authz:1",
      "cwe_id": "CWE-862",
      "explanation": "The diff adds explicit permission checks (`request.user.has_perm('authentik_providers_ssf.add_stream', self.provider)`) to all stream management endpoints (GET, PATCH, PUT, DELETE, VERIFY, STATUS). This addresses a potential missing authorization flaw (CWE-862) by ensuring that only users with the specific permission on the provider can access or modify the stream. The accompanying tests verify that users without this permission are correctly rejected with a 403 status code.",
      "evidence": [
